@politics
on-arrival: {!
Q.members_total_disp = Q.members_total.toFixed(2);
Q.a_memberdecline_disp = -(Q.membermonthly*1000).toFixed(0);
Q.left_strength_disp = Q.left_strength.toFixed(0)
Q.left_worker_strength_disp = Q.left_worker_strength.toFixed(0)
Q.technocrat_strength_disp = Q.technocrat_strength.toFixed(0)
Q.right_worker_strength_disp = Q.right_worker_strength.toFixed(0)
!}

= **The Party**

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The strength of our party-machine is our most important metric – it acts as a multiplier for many actions we take. \n\nFirst and foremost it is a product of the size and activity of our membership. However, a strong proffesional bureaucracy and an effective media apparatus can partially compensate for a weaker membership.">Party-machine</span>!}: [+ efc : efc +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="A proffesional bureaucracy can help compensate for a weaker membership, however the professionalisation of our bureaucracy also discourages party activity.">Bureaucracy</span>!}: [+ a_bureau : a_bureau +]

