Youth party: 1

*Surplus Resources: [+ resources +]*

**Membership**

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Our membership count is affected by the internal dissent and long time members dying. /nIt is positively affected by recruitment drives, efficiency and popularity.">Membership count</span>!}: [+ members_total_disp +]0

Last six weeks: [+ a_memberdecline_disp +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The level of activity among our members is negatively affected by the proffesionalization of our bureaucracy and trends downwards over time. \nIt is positively affected by elections, party congresses as well as investment and reliance on from leadership. Our youth movement is especially active. ">Level of activity</span>!}: [+ a_activity : a_activity +]

**Factions**<br>Overall Sentiment: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The SDS (Social Democratic Society) constitutes our parties most radical left, members of SDS are interested in radical anticapitalist policies both inside and outside our borders.\n\nIdeology: Democratic Socialism, Marxism, Anti-Atlanticism, New-Left, Modernism.">SDS</span>!} strength: [+ left_strength_disp +]%, <br>sentiment: [+ left_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Left-Workerists are made up of our most active union members, they seek to decisively shift the balance of class forces in Denmark.\n\nIdeology: Democratic Socialism, Keynesianism, Reformist Marxism, Trade-Unionism.">Left-Workerists</span>!} strength: [+ left_worker_strength_disp +]%, <br>sentiment: [+ left_worker_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Technocrats are made up of academics and pragmatic modernists, willing to deal with the forces of capital on a case by case basis.\n\nIdeology: Democratic Socialism, Keynesianism, Pragmatism, Modernism.">Technocrats</span>!} strength: [+ technocrat_strength_disp +]%, <br>sentiment: [+ technocrat_dissent : dissent +]

[? if cd_formed = 0 : {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Right-Workerists are sceptical of the left, the youth movement and modernist culture. They seek to expand the welfare state, strengthen our unions and protect the interests of car and homeowners.\n\nIdeology: Trade-Unionism, Pragmatism, Rindallism, Car Owner Interests, Homeowner Interests."">Right-Workerists</span>!} strength: [+ right_worker_strength_disp +]%, <br>sentiment: [+ right_worker_dissent : dissent +]?]
[? if cd_formed > 0 : {!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Pragmatists are see the left, SDS and some parts of the youth movement as obstacles to our progress. They seek to expand the welfare state, strengthen our unions and protect the interests of the modern worker.\n\nIdeology: Trade-Unionism, Pragmatism, Rindallism, Car Owner Interests, Homeowner Interests."">Pragmatists</span>!} strength: [+ right_worker_strength_disp +]%, <br>sentiment: [+ right_worker_dissent : dissent +]?]




